<title>USA: IHF Capital withdraws IPO of ICON Health.</title>
<headline>IHF Capital withdraws IPO of ICON Health.</headline>
<dateline>LOGAN, Utah 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>IHF Capital Inc said it has withdrawn the proposed public offering of ICON Health and Fitness Inc.</p>
<p>IHF declined to reveal why it is withdrawing the offering.</p>
</text>
